    <custom_item>
      type        : CMD_EXEC
      description : "RHEL-10-200611 - RHEL 10 must have the \"pcscd\" socket set to active."
      info        : "The information system ensures that even if the information system is compromised, that compromise will not affect credentials stored on the authentication device.

The daemon program for pcsc-lite and the MuscleCard framework is pcscd. It is a resource manager that coordinates communications with smart card readers and smart cards and cryptographic tokens that are connected to the system."
      solution    : "Configure RHEL 10 to have the \"pcscd\" socket set to active with the following command:

$ sudo systemctl enable --now pcscd.socket"
