      description : "RHEL-10-200740 - RHEL 10 must have the \"gnutls-utils\" package installed."
      info        : "\"GnuTLS\" is a secure communications library implementing the Secure Sockets Layer (SSL), Transport Layer Security (TLS), and Datagram TLS (DTLS) protocols and technologies around them. It provides a simple C language application programming interface (API) to access the secure communications protocols as well as APIs to parse and write X.509, PKCS #12, OpenPGP, and other required structures. This package contains command line TLS client and server and certificate manipulation tools."
