    <custom_item>
      type        : FILE_CHECK
      description : "RHEL-10-400265 - RHEL 10 must enforce mode \"0644\" or less permissive for the \"/etc/passwd\" file to prevent unauthorized access."
      info        : "If the \"/etc/passwd\" file is writable by a group-owner or the world, the risk of its compromise is increased. The file contains the list of accounts on the system and associated information, and protection of this file is critical for system security."
