      description : "RHEL-10-500000 - RHEL 10 must enable the systemd-journald service."
      info        : "In the event of a system failure, RHEL 10 must preserve any information necessary to determine cause of failure and return to operations with least disruption to system processes."
      solution    : "Configure RHEL 10 to enable the systemd-journald service.

